  "description": "Projects the total economic value of a fan throughout their relationship with the platform",
  "definition": "FLV = MV \\times \\left(1 - \\frac{RRF}{10}\\right) \\times (1 + FEI) \\times 24, \\text{ estimating 24-month value adjusted by retention risk and engagement level.}"
